    "tags": ["parser: HTML", "html_attribute", "generated: calculated", "connector: static", "offline"],
    "description": "response_type \"HTML\" fields can read three different things off the same element: the text (type string), an attribute via html_attribute (e.g. href), or the inner markup itself (type html) \u2014 handy when you need to keep formatting instead of just the plain text.",
